  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National River Basin Plan II 2013-2020 - Support to PNC II 2013-2015</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nationell plan f&#xf6;r avrinningsomr&#xe5;den II 2013-2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet st&#xf6;djer n&#xe4;sta 5-&#xe5;rs plan f&#xf6;r avrinningsomr&#xe5;den i Bolivia   (Plan Nacional de Cuencas II) 2013-2017. De viktigaste m&#xe5;len under    andra fasen &#xe4;r institutionsuppbyggnad,&#xf6;verf&#xf6;ring av ansvar till       departements- och kommunal niv&#xe5;, fr&#xe4;mjande av planeringsverktyg i     f&#xf6;rvaltning av avrinningsomr&#xe5;den, inklusive de som r&#xf6;r                katastrofriskhantering, klimatf&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar och vattenkvalitet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program supports the next 5-year plan for river basins in Bolivia (Plan Nacional de Cuenca II) from 2013 to 2017. The main objectives   of the second phase are institution building, transfer of             responsibilities to the departmental and municipal level, promotion   of planning tools in river basin management, including those related  to disaster risk management, climate change and water quality.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support to PNC II is designed to support the consolidation for the national river basin plan (Plan Nacional de Cuencas - PNC II). The program has mechanisms for the planning of water management where stakeholders from different sectors and interest in water use meet and discuss issues and provide suggested solutions. The main objectives of PNC II is institution building and the transfer of responsibility from VRHR (Department of water Resources and irrigation) to municipalities, promotion of territorial planning in the management of river basins, especially those for disaster risk reduction, climate change adaptation and disaster risk reduction is amplified.</narrative>
  </description>
